      "question": "What is the measure of each interior angle of a regular hexagon?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "90°",
        "B": "108°",
        "C": "120°",
        "D": "135°",
        "E": "144°"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "For a regular n-gon, each interior angle = (n - 2) × 180° / n. For hexagon (n = 6): (6 - 2) × 180° / 6 = 4 × 180° / 6 = 720° / 6 = 120°.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Formula: Interior angle = (n - 2) × 180° / n.",
        "2. For hexagon, n = 6.",
        "3. = (6 - 2) × 180° / 6 = 4 × 30° = 120°."
      ],
      "fastStrategy": "Regular polygon interior angle: (n - 2) × 180° / n."
